# NOTICE

This repository is an independent reimplementation of the observable behavior of
the CM2 HexaMesh Iso 5.7 evaluation demo. It contains no vendor source code,
no vendor binaries (EXE/DLL), no input .dat files, and no decompiler output.

The implementation was written from black-box execution results and static
analysis of the demo executable. It is not a recovery of the original C++
source, and it is not a strict clean-room implementation: the authors did
inspect disassembly and decompiled pseudocode of the demo and its DLLs in order
to understand file formats and behavior.

